This is your home directory on SIEOS.

Try:
  id ; ls -l /etc /dev
  echo "hello world" > hello.txt ; cat hello.txt | grep hello
  sleep 100 &          # background job
  jobs ; fg %1         # then press ^Z to stop it, 'bg' to resume it
  yes | head -n 3      # pipelines
  su                   # become root (password: root)
